{"id":"5019","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5019_main_spray_hydrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在这张照片中可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>处的喷流，是因强风将水滴从水面吹起并将其带入空气中的一小段距离而形成的。在背景中，海浪撞击沿海岩石也导致大量水滴进入空气。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国康沃尔郡Kynance Cave","latitude":"纬度: 49° 58' 25'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 13' 36'' W","date":"08 February 2016 1530 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.11.3.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.11.3.3"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4633_main_spray-and-a-sea-spray-bow_hydrometeors-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">喷雾</span>是由从广阔水体表面的风吹起的水滴集合产生，通常来自波峰，并可向上吹向空中一小段距离。</p>\n<p>在这张照片中，广阔的水体是太平洋，风将美国加利福尼亚州海岸的帕西菲卡海浪吹起了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">喷雾</span>。</p>\n<p>随着太阳的照射，在喷雾“幕”中形成了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">海浪虹</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Mila Zinkova","location":"美国加利福尼亚帕西菲卡","latitude":"纬度: 37° 35' 51'' N","longitude":"经度: 122° 30' 46'' W","date":"27 January 2016 1514 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.11.3.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.11.3.3"}]}]}